# Copy this file to .env for local development only. Never commit the real .env.
#
# TWITCH_CLIENT_ID: the Client ID of a Twitch application you register yourself
# at https://dev.twitch.tv/console -> Register Your Application.
#   - Application type: "Public" (no client secret — this app uses the
#     Device Code OAuth flow, which never needs one).
#   - OAuth Redirect URL: http://localhost (unused by Device Code Flow, but
#     Twitch requires a value here to save the app).
#
# In production the user pastes their own client_id into the app's Settings
# window instead of using this file — this is only a convenience for `npm run
# tauri dev`.
TWITCH_CLIENT_ID=
